# Authors

sofi is a hard fork of rofi. Everyone listed here holds copyright in some part
of the code that ships in this repository, under the MIT/X11 licence in COPYING.

## sofi

- orpheus497 <orpheus497@gmail.com>

## rofi

The fork point. Maintained by Dave Davenport (Qball), with Wayland support
originating in the long-running fork by lbonn.

- Qball Cow <qball@gmpclient.org>
- Morgane Glidic <sardemff7+rofi@sardemff7.net>
- Rasmus Steinke <rasi@xssn.at>
- lbonn <https://github.com/lbonn>
- Leandro Vital <leavitals@gmail.com>

For the full rofi contributor history, see
<https://github.com/davatorium/rofi/graphs/contributors>.

## simpleswitcher

rofi began as a clone of simpleswitcher, which was itself roughly based on
superswitcher.

- Sean Pringle <sean.pringle@gmail.com>

## Bundled and adapted code

`script/sofi-sensible-terminal` was released into the public domain by Han Boetes
<han@mijncomputer.nl> and reached sofi by way of i3 and rofi.

## Bundled subprojects

`subprojects/libgwater` and `subprojects/libnkutils` are by Morgane Glidic and
carry their own licences; see the respective directories.
